{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00851","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 朱鹭 · 张籍","name":"鼓吹曲辞 朱鹭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩兮朱鹭，来泛春塘栖绿树。\n羽毛如翦色如染，远飞欲下双翅敛。\n避人引子入深壍，动处水纹开灩灩。\n谁知豪家网尔躯，不如饮啄江海隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}